Package: CooccurrenceAnalysis
Title: Domain-Neutral Co-Occurrence Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Brian", "Chapman", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Pairwise association statistics between items that co-occur
    within records, significance-filtered co-occurrence networks (one-sided
    Fisher exact tests with Benjamini-Hochberg correction), Louvain
    community detection, per-node network metrics, a hierarchical
    Dirichlet process Bernoulli mixture fit jointly across groups by
    coordinate-ascent variational inference, and their plots. An R
    port of the Julia 'CooccurrenceAnalysis' package; it carries no domain
    vocabulary.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
